ata</a><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/markup_language">Markup&nbsp;Languages</a><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/character_encoding">Character&nbsp;Encodings</a><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/image_format">Image&nbsp;File&nbsp;Formats</a><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/top_level_domain">Top&nbsp;Level&nbsp;Domains</a><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/server_location">Server&nbsp;Locations</a><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/content_language">Content&nbsp;Languages</a><br><br><h3><b>Trends</b></h3><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/history_details/cm-wordpress/6.9">Version History</a><br><br></td><td class=tech_main><p><p><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies">Technologies</a> &gt; <a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/content_management">Content Management</a> &gt; <a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress">WordPress</a> &gt; Version 6.9<h1>Usage statistics and market share of WordPress Version 6.9</h1><div class=report_info_r>Request an <b>extensive WordPress market report.</b><br><br><a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/report/cm-wordpress">Learn more</a></div><p>These diagrams show the usage statistics of WordPress version 6.9 as content management system on the web. See <a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies">technologies overview</a> for explanations on the methodologies used in the surveys. Our reports are updated daily.<p class=surv><b>WordPress version 6.9 is used by 4.9%</b> of all the websites whose <a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/overview/content_management">content management system</a> we know. <b>This is 3.3% of all websites</b>.</p><p><br>The diagram shows the percentage of websites using WordPress version 6.9 as content management system.<p>How to read the diagram:<br>WordPress is used by 38.7% of all the websites.<br>Version 6.9 is used by 3.3% of all the websites.</p><table class=bars><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress">WordPress</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:117px"></div><td>38.7%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6">Version 6</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:29px"></div><td>9.3%</table><tr><th><b>Version 6.9</b><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:11px"></div><td>3.3%</table><tr><th class=cap1><td class=cap1>W3Techs.com, 14 November 2026<tr><td class=cap2 colspan=2>Percentage of websites using WordPress</table><h2>Subversions of WordPress 6.9</h2><p>This diagram shows the percentages of websites using various subversions of WordPress 6.9.<p>How to read the diagram:<br>Version 6.9.10 is used by 26.5% of all the websites who use WordPress version 6.9.</p><table class=bars><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.10" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.10</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:80px"></div><td>26.5%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.4" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.4</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:63px"></div><td>20.7%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.9" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.9</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:50px"></div><td>16.5%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.11" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.11</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:43px"></div><td>14.0%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.7" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.7</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:26px"></div><td>8.2%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.1" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.1</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:20px"></div><td>6.3%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.8" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.8</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:15px"></div><td>4.7%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.5" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.5</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:8px"></div><td>2.5%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.6" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.6</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:2px"></div><td>0.4%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.3" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.3</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:2px"></div><td>0.2%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9.2" rel=nofollow>Version 6.9.2</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>0.1%</table><tr><th class=cap1><td class=cap1>W3Techs.com, 14 November 2026<tr><td class=cap2 colspan=2>Percentages of websites using various subversions of WordPress 6.9</table><br><h2>Popular sites using WordPress version 6.9</h2><ul><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/bild.de">Bild.de</a> <span class=si_hint>used on inner pages</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/ticketmaster.com">Ticketmaster.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/techcrunch.com">Techcrunch.com</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/cnet.com">Cnet.com</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/studocu.com">Studocu.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on inner pages</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/thesimsresource.com">Thesimsresource.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/fantia.jp">Fantia.jp</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/rip.ie">Rip.ie</a> <span class=si_hint>used on inner pages</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/dtdc.com">Dtdc.com</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/samehadaku.how">Samehadaku.how</a></ul><h2>Free technology usage monitoring service</h2><p><a href="https://w3techs.com/users/technologies/cm-wordpress" rel=nofollow>Get a notification</a> when a top site starts using WordPress.<h3>Share this page</h3><ul class="share-buttons"><li><a href="mailto:?subject=Usage statistics and market share of WordPress Version 6.9&body=Usage statistics and market share of WordPress Version 6.9 - https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6.9" title="Send email"><img loading=lazy alt="Send email" src="https://w3techs.com/pictures/Email.svg"></a><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fdetails%2Fcm-wordpress%2F6.9" title="Share on LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" onclick="window.open('https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fdetails%2Fcm-wordpress%2F6.9', '_blank', 'width=600,height=400'); return false;"><img loading=lazy alt="Share on LinkedIn" src="https://w3techs.com/pictures/LinkedIn.svg"></a><li><a href="https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text=Usage+statistics+and+market+share+of+WordPress+Version+6.9 - https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fdetails%2Fcm-wordpress%2F6.9&via=W3Techs" title="Post on Bluesky" target="_blank" rel="nofollow no